ColorTrace's reference-media manifest identifies 240 unmodified linear OpenEXR source
frames. Those source frames are downloaded into an external cache and are not
redistributed with this source repository. The small PNG previews distributed with the
ColorTrace API are modified derivatives: they are color-transformed, resized, and, for
difference views, computed and amplified. Their exact source-frame and transformation
provenance is recorded in the accompanying preview manifest.
